s agreeing is not independent source corroboration</data><data key="d1">constraint</data><data key="d2">{}</data></node><node id="constraint:public_only"><data key="d0">Search/dorking restricted to public/authorized discovery; no credential harvesting/private access/CAPTCHA bypass</data><data key="d1">constraint</data><data key="d2">{}</data></node><node id="constraint:geo_precision"><data key="d0">Avoid false precise geolocation; confidence separated by geographic level</data><data key="d1">constraint</data><data key="d2">{}</data></node><node id="policy:autonomy"><data key="d0">Autonomous investigation, not autonomous external action</data><data key="d1">policy</data><data key="d2">{"allowed": ["public/authorized search", "collection", "parsing", "normalization", "correlation", "entity resolution", "graph/timeline analysis", "hypothesis generation/testing", "verification", "reporting"], "prohibited": ["auth bypass", "CAPTCHA bypass", "private accounts", "stolen credentials", "exploitation", "malware deployment", "illicit purchase", "unauthorized active scanning", "contacting subjects", "publishing allegations", "autonomous legal/financial/police decisions"]}</data></node><node id="flow:ingestion"><data key="d0">Unknown input → detect → quarantine → preserve original → parse → normalize → extract → map → validate → correlate → analyze</data><data key="d1">workflow</data><data key="d2">{}</data></node><node id="flow:dualai"><data key="d0">Deterministic validation → AI Pass 1 → independent AI Pass 2 → cross-check → adjudication if needed</data><data key="d1">workflow</data><data key="d2">{}</data></node><node id="flow:dork"><data key="d0">Objective → query families → provider-specific compile → multi-engine execution → GitHub/public Telegram/archive/public sources → evidence → dual AI → graph/timeline/report/save</data><data key="d1">workflow</data><data key="d2">{}</data></node><node id="flow:malware"><data key="d0">Internet/feeds/reports → evidence → source checks 